      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790174897853,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For navigation:\nEvery time we go to a new page\nwe push that page onto a stack\n\nTo go Back I simply pop from the stack\nand go to the page underneath",
